WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
I often get asked if I think I'm&nbsp;
ever going to build something useful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.850
and maybe someday I will.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.050
But the way I&nbsp;see it,

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.897
I already have because I've 
built myself this job.

00:00:09.897 --> 00:00:11.930
It's something&nbsp;that I could 
never have planned for,

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.651
Instead it happened just because I was
&nbsp;enthusiastic about what I was doing,

00:00:15.651 --> 00:00:18.304
and I was sharing that 
enthusiasm with other&nbsp;people.

00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:21.213
To me that's the true 
beauty of making useless things,

00:00:21.213 --> 00:00:25.780
because it's this acknowledgment&nbsp;that you 
don't always know what the best answer is.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:28.160
And it turns off that voice in your head

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.547
that&nbsp;tells you that you know 
exactly how the world works.

00:00:31.547 --> 00:00:34.000
And maybe a toothbrush 
helmet isn't the&nbsp;answer,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.744
but at least you're asking the question.

